{
  "uid": "scarab-overview",
  "title": "Scarab overview",
  "tags": [
    "scarab",
    "network",
    "tip"
  ],
  "description": "Start here: live per-node health, peer targets, chain activity and links to deeper network, chain and producer dashboards.",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "host",
        "label": "Host",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(up{job=\"scarab\"}, host)",
          "refId": "host-variable"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(up{job=\"scarab\"}, host)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "container",
        "label": "Node",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(up{job=\"scarab\", host=~\"$host\"}, container)",
          "refId": "container-variable"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(up{job=\"scarab\", host=~\"$host\"}, container)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Start here",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Compare **each node with its own peers**. Pascal/preprod and Rutherford/mainnet have different chains: their block and slot numbers are not comparable.\n\nUse **Network** for peer states, discovery, failures and connection lifecycles; **Chain tip** for block activity, validation, rollbacks, ledger, mempool and storage; **Pool** for our producer and KES; **Runs** and **Node Exporter Full** for raw logs and machine resources.\n\n**Hot** means active; **warm** means established but inactive; **cold** means known but disconnected. Totals below include ordinary **and** big-ledger peers. Missing telemetry stays missing; it is not treated as a healthy zero."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Live node state",
      "id": 2,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Metrics scrape up",
      "description": "1 means the endpoint answered. It does not prove every collector updated or that the node is at network tip.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "min by (host, container) (up{job=\"scarab\", host=~\"$host\", container=~\"$container\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} {{container}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "No samples",
          "decimals": 0,
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Network for this node",
              "url": "/d/scarab-network?var-host=${__field.labels.host}&var-container=${__field.labels.container}&${__url_time_range}",
              "targetBlank": false
            },
            {
              "title": "Chain tip for this node",
              "url": "/d/scarab-chain-tip?var-host=${__field.labels.host}&var-container=${__field.labels.container}&${__url_time_range}",
              "targetBlank": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
